        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write a description of an invented monster: how many heads, arms, eyes and legs it has.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Give aloud the instructions for a short stretching routine, naming the parts of the body."
